      "text": "GET https://api-parking-lot-app.company.com/parking-lot\nAuthorization: bearer 8398398.389389839.389839\n\nBearer tokens are a security risk.\n    - what if you accidentally attach them to a request to the wrong server?\n    - what if you send them not using https? (interception), etc.\n    - FAIRLY easy to hack.\n",
